chapter.v:
He who 


walks blamelessly, 


and does what is right and speaks truth in his heart;

who does 


not slander, 


with his tongue and does no evil to his neighbor, nor takes up a reproach against his friend;

in whose 


eyes a, 


vile person is despised, but who honors those who fear the LORD; who swears to his own hurt and does not change;
